'''Sunsworn Camp''' is an [[Alliance]]-aligned encampment located in southwest [[Moonwhisper Coast]]. It is the base camp of a high elven expedition led by [[Andanil Sunsworn]], cousin to Lord [[Astalor Sunsworn]] of the [[Silvermoon Remnant]], sent to Moonwhisper Coast in search of [[draenethyst]].

